{
  "name": "Zero-Bounce B2B Lead Qualification, Trust Center & AI-Readiness Pipeline (Apify + Google Sheets + Slack)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Trigger & Lead Input\n\nRuns on a **daily schedule** or manually for one-off lead list cleaning.\n\n- Replace **Sample Lead List** with a Google Sheets, HubSpot, Airtable, or Webhook node.\n- **Prepare Domain Batch** automatically extracts clean domains from emails/URLs, deduplicates them, and formats the batch payload.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-stage-1",
      "name": "Note: Stage 1 - Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. 5-in-1 Pre-Flight Enrichment (Apify)\n\nCalls **`lu-tools/b2b-domain-preflight-fusion`** in 1 fast, zero-proxy request to audit:\n1. MX / Recursive SPF (10-lookup check) / DMARC / DKIM\n2. Public DNSBL blocklist reputation\n3. TLS/SSL expiry & security headers\n4. Tech stack & parked-domain detection\n5. `/llms.txt`, AI crawler policies & Vanta/Drata Trust Centers\n\n### Setup (60s)\nOpen **5-in-1 B2B Domain Pre-Flight** and configure Header Auth:\n- Name: `Authorization`\n- Value: `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note-stage-2",
      "name": "Note: Stage 2 - Apify Audit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [760, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Smart 3-Way Verdict Routing\n\nRoutes every audited domain automatically:\n- **READY**: Enterprise-ready domains -> sync to CRM sheet + notify Slack\n- **CAUTION**: Missing DMARC / SPF >10 lookups / freemail -> flag for manual review\n- **REJECT**: Disposable, parked, or DNSBL-listed -> export to suppression list",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-stage-3",
      "name": "Note: Stage 3 - Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1280, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. CRM Sync, Alerts & Suppression\n\nConnect your **Google Sheets** and **Slack** credentials on the downstream nodes.\n\n- Qualified leads include `outreachTier` (`VIP_ENTERPRISE` when a Trust Center or `llms.txt` is detected).\n- Rejected leads are formatted for your outbound Do-Not-Email suppression list.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "note-stage-4",
      "name": "Note: Stage 4 - Actions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1860, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [180, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "daily-schedule",
      "name": "Daily Lead Hygiene Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [180, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sample-leads",
              "name": "rawInputs",
              "value": "={{ [\"ops@stripe.com\", \"https://linear.app/pricing\", \"apify.com\", \"test@gmail.com\", \"spam@mailinator.com\"] }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sample-leads-set",
      "name": "Sample Lead List (Replace with CRM)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [400, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const rawList = $input.first().json.rawInputs || [];\nconst cleaned = [...new Set(\n  rawList\n    .map((v) => String(v || '').trim())\n    .filter(Boolean)\n)];\n\nif (cleaned.length === 0) {\n  return [];\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { domains: cleaned, batchSize: cleaned.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "prepare-batch",
      "name": "Deduplicate & Prepare Domain Batch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [620, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/lu-tools~b2b-domain-preflight-fusion/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"domains\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.domains) }},\n  \"includeAiReadiness\": true,\n  \"includeTrustCenterProbe\": true,\n  \"includeDnsbl\": true,\n  \"compactMode\": true,\n  \"maxConcurrency\": 5\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-preflight-call",
      "name": "5-in-1 B2B Domain Pre-Flight (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [860, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(({ json }) => {\n  const isVip = json.verdict === 'READY' && (json.hasTrustCenter || json.leadQualityScore >= 90);\n  return {\n    json: {\n      domain: json.domain,\n      verdict: json.verdict,\n      grade: json.grade,\n      leadQualityScore: json.leadQualityScore,\n      outreachTier: isVip ? 'VIP_ENTERPRISE' : json.verdict === 'READY' ? 'STANDARD_B2B' : 'HOLD_OR_SUPPRESS',\n      emailProvider: json.emailProvider,\n      dmarcPolicy: json.dmarcPolicy,\n      spfLookupCount: json.spfLookupCount,\n      hasTrustCenter: Boolean(json.hasTrustCenter),\n      trustCenterProvider: json.trustCenterProvider || 'None',\n      hasLlmsTxt: Boolean(json.hasLlmsTxt),\n      techStack: Array.isArray(json.techStack) ? json.techStack.join(', ') : '',\n      redFlags: Array.isArray(json.redFlags) ? json.redFlags.join(', ') : '',\n      auditedAt: json.auditedAt\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "enrich-crm-fields",
      "name": "Format CRM Fields & Assign Tier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1100, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.verdict }}",
                    "rightValue": "READY",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "READY"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.verdict }}",
                    "rightValue": "CAUTION",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "CAUTION"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.verdict }}",
                    "rightValue": "REJECT",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "REJECT"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "switch-verdict",
      "name": "Route by Verdict (READY / CAUTION / REJECT)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [1360, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Qualified_Leads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-ready",
      "name": "Save Qualified Leads to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1680, 280]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "={{ `*New Qualified B2B Lead (${$json.outreachTier})*\\n• Domain: ${$json.domain}\\n• Score: ${$json.leadQualityScore}/100 (Grade ${$json.grade})\\n• Email: ${$json.emailProvider} (DMARC: ${$json.dmarcPolicy})\\n• Trust Center: ${$json.trustCenterProvider} | llms.txt: ${$json.hasLlmsTxt}\\n• Stack: ${$json.techStack || 'N/A'}` }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "slack-notify-ready",
      "name": "Notify Sales Channel in Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1960, 280]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Caution_Review",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-caution",
      "name": "Log Caution Leads for Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1680, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "suppressed-domain",
              "name": "suppressedDomain",
              "value": "={{ $json.domain }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "suppression-reason",
              "name": "suppressionReason",
              "value": "={{ $json.redFlags || 'Low pre-flight quality score' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "suppressed-at",
              "name": "suppressedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.auditedAt }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "prepare-suppression",
      "name": "Prepare Do-Not-Email Suppression Entry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1680, 640]
    }
  ],
